Copyright 2026 Rainer Türner

This product is a Rust rewrite of the original Resql Spring Boot service
first developed at Bürokratt (https://github.com/buerokratt/Resql) in
August 2022 as part of the Bürokratt / Bükstack ecosystem.

The original Java implementation is licensed separately; consult the
upstream repository for its terms. This rewrite is an independent work
under the Apache License 2.0 and shares no code with the upstream
implementation. Interface compatibility (SQL-file-to-endpoint semantics,
JSON parameter binding, snake_case → camelCase result column renaming)
is intentional and follows public interface documentation.
